{"id":"657630","name":"虾牛烩","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657630/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾","amount":"适量"},{"name":"莲藕","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/657630/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入生抽，蚝油，老抽，玉米淀粉。","img":"images/657630/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"抓拌均匀后加入花生油拌匀静置20分钟。","img":"images/657630/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鲜虾剪去虾枪虾须后开背去虾线，再洗净。","img":"images/657630/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"莲藕洗净去皮切薄片。","img":"images/657630/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜头剁碎，干辣椒切碎，香葱洗净切葱花备用。","img":"images/657630/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅中热油放入火锅底料。","img":"images/657630/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒香。","img":"images/657630/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/657630/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入莲藕。","img":"images/657630/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火煮开将莲藕煮至断生捞出。","img":"images/657630/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入牛肉。","img":"images/657630/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"虾也一起下锅（喜欢香一点的可以把虾油炸一下）。","img":"images/657630/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火煮开至牛肉和虾断生捞出装盘。","img":"images/657630/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放上芥末和干辣椒，淋上热油，放入葱花即可。","img":"images/657630/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657630/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657630/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657630/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657630/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657630/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}